# Moment of Truth's Progress replies against the rival containers at the same places (task 5 review Important 1; see
# waking_the_colossus#rivals). main (a level 50 Corsair at the Whitegate's area 5, 802 at Prog 0): Against All Odds
# (available: 797, a Progress): the two tie, the first container's, then the other rotated (an Event in place of 802
# would lose both entries); 802's finish sets Prog 1, 797's begins Against All Odds. bob (Jade Sepulcher's _1v0, 3 at
# Prog 3): Puppet in Peril (ToAU 29, status 0: 4, a Progress): 4 first, whose finish sets the mission status 1; a GM
# resets it; 3 rotated.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 JadeSepulcher/_1v0/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=80,-6,-140 job=COR lvl=50 nation=1
char bob zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
quest AhtUrhgan.GivePeaceAChance completed
quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth accepted
charvar Quest[6][30]Prog 0
quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw completed
quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.GivePeaceAChance completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.MomentOfTruth accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][30]Prog 3
bob: mission Toau PuppetInPeril current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 80,-6,-130                         # area 5: 797 and 802 tie: the first container's
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds available   # a GM: 797's begin undone
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # rotated: the other
finish                                  # Prog 1
bob: login
bob: trigger _1v0                       # 4 and 3 tie: the mission's first
bob: finish
bob: missionstatus Toau 0               # a GM
bob: trigger _1v0                       # rotated: 3
bob: finish
